  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">作词 : Jackson Shanks/Supreme Boi/Ali Tamposi/Feli Ferraro/SCORE(13)/Megatone(13)/“hitman”bang/许允真</p>
      <p begin="00:01.000" end="00:06.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">作曲 : Jackson Shanks/Supreme Boi/Ali Tamposi/Feli Ferraro/SCORE(13)/Megatone(13)/“hitman”bang/许允真</p>
      <p begin="00:06.880" end="00:10.570" ttm:agent="v1">危険なdrive 変えてgear</p>
      <p begin="00:10.570" end="00:14.390" ttm:agent="v1">沈む日 二人のtears so</p>
      <p begin="00:14.390" end="00:18.130" ttm:agent="v1">Don't be afraid 間違いない</p>
      <p begin="00:18.130" end="00:19.630" ttm:agent="v1">手繋ごう</p>
      <p begin="00:19.280" end="00:23.110" ttm:agent="v1">Cause tonight we will burn to shine yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:23.110" end="00:24.920" ttm:agent="v1">抱き締めて my dear</p>
      <p begin="00:24.920" end="00:30.570" ttm:agent="v1">同じ傷口 この胸分け合って</p>
      <p begin="00:30.570" end="00:33.580" ttm:agent="v1">紅のエンジン キミの目に</p>
      <p begin="00:33.580" end="00:36.380" ttm:agent="v1">永遠に記憶してよ</p>
      <p begin="00:36.380" end="00:38.780" ttm:agent="v1">I'm burning HOT</p>
      <p begin="00:38.780" end="00:42.610" ttm:agent="v1">私で生きれるなら</p>
      <p begin="00:42.610" end="00:46.310" ttm:agent="v1">灰になってもいいわ</p>
      <p begin="00:46.310" end="00:49.850" ttm:agent="v1">So tonight 胸の中で</p>
      <p begin="00:49.850" end="00:52.980" ttm:agent="v1">Bonnie and Clyde it oh</p>
      <p begin="00:52.980" end="00:54.480" ttm:agent="v1">Not running from it</p>
      <p begin="00:54.230" end="00:56.660" ttm:agent="v1">Not running from it</p>
      <p begin="00:56.660" end="00:58.900" ttm:agent="v1">燃え上がり I love it</p>
      <p begin="00:58.900" end="01:02.670" ttm:agent="v1">生かされる</p>
      <p begin="01:02.670" end="01:08.020" ttm:agent="v1">I'm burning HOT</p>
      <p begin="01:08.020" end="01:11.680" ttm:agent="v1">マジ 永遠へ飛ぶ不死鳥のように</p>
      <p begin="01:11.680" end="01:15.350" ttm:agent="v1">まさに 奇跡のよう夢見させるキミ</p>
      <p begin="01:15.350" end="01:19.340" ttm:agent="v1">再び 蘇る火花 ピオナ</p>
      <p begin="01:19.340" end="01:21.510" ttm:agent="v1">生える翼</p>
      <p begin="01:21.510" end="01:23.030" ttm:agent="v1">Now hold me tight</p>
      <p begin="01:23.030" end="01:24.900" ttm:agent="v1">身を投げ出す 火</p>
      <p begin="01:24.900" end="01:26.760" ttm:agent="v1">一点も無い後悔</p>
      <p begin="01:26.760" end="01:30.610" ttm:agent="v1">It's all right we're ride or die yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:30.610" end="01:33.590" ttm:agent="v1">紅のエンジン キミの目に</p>
      <p begin="01:33.590" end="01:36.470" ttm:agent="v1">永遠に記憶してよ</p>
      <p begin="01:36.470" end="01:38.860" ttm:agent="v1">I'm burning HOT</p>
      <p begin="01:38.860" end="01:42.580" ttm:agent="v1">私で生きれるなら</p>
      <p begin="01:42.580" end="01:46.280" ttm:agent="v1">灰になってもいいわ</p>
      <p begin="01:46.280" end="01:49.800" ttm:agent="v1">So tonight 胸の中で</p>
      <p begin="01:49.800" end="01:52.920" ttm:agent="v1">Bonnie and Clyde it oh</p>
      <p begin="01:52.920" end="01:54.420" ttm:agent="v1">Not running from it</p>
      <p begin="01:54.290" end="01:56.500" ttm:agent="v1">Not running from it</p>
      <p begin="01:56.500" end="01:58.660" ttm:agent="v1">燃え上がり I love it</p>
      <p begin="01:58.660" end="02:02.720" ttm:agent="v1">生かされる</p>
      <p begin="02:02.720" end="02:04.220" ttm:agent="v1">I'm burning HOT</p>
      <p begin="02:04.060" end="02:08.060" ttm:agent="v1">I'm burning HOT</p>
    </div>
